# Two TrainingService classes

Two classes named `TrainingService` coexist on purpose:

| Name | Module | Job |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Planner | `app.domain.training.TrainingService` | Sessions, wall overview, daily workout ticks |
| Legacy log | `app.domain.training_logs.TrainingService` | `/workout`, `/training/plans`, program text |

Do not collapse them without checking `docs/agent-handoff-chili.md` and `docs/agent-handoff-efficiency.md` (Cut 5).
